            "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/e7aa1a6a96e55eaddca33b86a1fbbeb0.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Four new evolutions, including the 3 winning community designs. Two new genetics. Several new free cosmetics. Mid-Run Saves in Endless, Challenges, and regular Pressure Runs. Controller Snapping and Improvements. The Up and Down Buttons on the D-Pad can now be used on Scroll Bars to allow faster access. Cursor control can still be accessed with the Right Thumbstick, but now the Left Thumbstick will easily snap to menu elements and interactive points. Accessibility Settings for the cursor. Quality of Life Changes. Improved World map generation; now maps will feature more elements such as flora, rocks, and trees in more locations. Large areas will no longer appear barren. Clawdia will no longer spawn eggs while performing her other attacks at the same time. Bug Fixes. Using Moulting during a Blizzard will no longer launch the player in the wind&#039;s direction. Fixed an issue with Steam Decks launching in an incorrect resolution.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras_big/e7aa1a6a96e55eaddca33b86a1fbbeb0.webp?t=1789140388 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/93e64c02d0725976ef85e3b8dc669f43.avif?t=1789140388\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras_big/93e64c02d0725976ef85e3b8dc669f43.webp?t=1789140388 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/f4d8280666801f227724f84407e67491.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;The Animal Evolution Roguelite&amp;quot;\" width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a <strong>living ecosystem</strong>, 'Everything is Crab' is a <strong>cute, challenging, highly replayable action roguelite</strong>. Make animal inspired <strong>evolutionary choices</strong> to concoct your own unique creature every run, both mechanically and visually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's <strong>Spore </strong>meets <strong>Modern Roguelites</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/88caa06ab1c3af489112685f32357e59.poster.avif?t=1789140388\" aria-label=\"Gameplay video showing different player evolutions running through grassy, desert, and snowy environments, dodging attacks from different critters. Pop-up menus reveal different Evolution options (applying scales, more mass, or sharpened claws), and bonus activations (the Mud Pond choice letting players select from decreased damage with &#039;mud bath&#039;, increased hot and cold resistance with &#039;thermoregulate&#039;, or increased social stats with &#039;scent marking&#039;).\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/88caa06ab1c3af489112685f32357e59.webm?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/88caa06ab1c3af489112685f32357e59.mp4?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/859ef9ea2f0284d5756305d9056d567c.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;Beat Carcinisation&amp;quot;\" width=1560 height=114 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As everybody knows, eventually, every organism ends up evolving into a crab. Right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, except for you. Choose your own evolutionary path and strategy to thrive and defeat convergent evolution. Take that, science!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/e1bb1acb0fc0b187543844a45c8649ca.poster.avif?t=1789140388\" aria-label=\"GIF showing a variety of different player evolutions, with the character gaining horns, tentacles, bat wings, snail cones, scorpion stingers, eyes-on-stalks, and more.\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/e1bb1acb0fc0b187543844a45c8649ca.webm?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/56b7b89a5b82b9c4707f4ef2c629599f.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;Evolve, Adapt, Overcome&amp;quot;\" width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 125 abilities combine to create a plethora of different builds and playstyles: Become a wily trickster, a ferocious predator, a gregarious leader, a nimble nomad, or take on any number of other survival strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legs! Claws! Pincers! Wings! More Legs! Fur! Tail! Scales! Tentacles! I SAID MORE LEGS!!! <br>Build your formidable, visually awkward chimera or get Darwin'd in the process.                                           </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.poster.avif?t=1789140388\" aria-label=\"Gameplay video showing three different boss characters attacking in a variety of biomes: one a cow/crab hybrid, one an elephant-like creature with a shell on its back, and on a wasp-like creation with crab claws.\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.webm?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.mp4?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/15439ac1fdec62e9c558930d66abd000.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;Features&amp;quot;\" width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>125+ evolution based abilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless possibilities and visual combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy-defining evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many viable survival strategies and playstyles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/2b990ccfd94bdf71f1f3d51e3707fdff.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Pixel art portrait of a cow.\" width=148 height=148 /></span>          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/75b4807fbab84baa5cb7591092e59dbe.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Pixel art portrait of a sloth.\" width=148 height=148 /></span>          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/9434e9c8d62d0b7f4ada9df94d503159.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Pixel art portrait of a camel.\" width=148 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living, thriving ecosystem</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different critters with their own goals and strategies, each of them with several stages of evolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four distinct biomes with different rules, climate events, points of interest, flora and fauna</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night and day cycle          </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/1c151d8ad85ecb6dd3e2b1008dcdb911.poster.avif?t=1789140388\" aria-label=\"Idle animation of the Crabtaur boss - a cow/crab hybrid.\" width=512 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/1c151d8ad85ecb6dd3e2b1008dcdb911.webm?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of bosses that may (or may not) appear with each run</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge meta-progression layer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulties system (if you dare!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genetics (starting Characters), which can be combined to create endless starting character combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Scenarios to push your adaptation skills to the limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More evolutions</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless runs</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your survival skills to unlock Endless runs, ditch the timer, and outlast the apocalypse! </p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track your findings, meta-progression and achievements in the Codex</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/c65d8d511265f0086e4320b607fca173.apng?t=1789140388\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/c65d8d511265f0086e4320b607fca173.poster.avif?t=1789140388\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"A bouncing hare.\" width=256 height=140 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Have a Crabby day!</strong></p>",
