 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/859ef9ea2f0284d5756305d9056d567c.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;Beat Carcinisation&amp;quot;\" width=1560 height=114 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As everybody knows, eventually, every organism ends up evolving into a crab. Right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, except for you. Choose your own evolutionary path and strategy to thrive and defeat convergent evolution. Take that, science!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/e1bb1acb0fc0b187543844a45c8649ca.poster.avif?t=1789140388\" aria-label=\"GIF showing a variety of different player evolutions, with the character gaining horns, tentacles, bat wings, snail cones, scorpion stingers, eyes-on-stalks, and more.\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/e1bb1acb0fc0b187543844a45c8649ca.webm?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/56b7b89a5b82b9c4707f4ef2c629599f.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;Evolve, Adapt, Overcome&amp;quot;\" width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 125 abilities combine to create a plethora of different builds and playstyles: Become a wily trickster, a ferocious predator, a gregarious leader, a nimble nomad, or take on any number of other survival strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legs! Claws! Pincers! Wings! More Legs! Fur! Tail! Scales! Tentacles! I SAID MORE LEGS!!! <br>Build your formidable, visually awkward chimera or get Darwin'd in the process.                                           </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.poster.avif?t=1789140388\" aria-label=\"Gameplay video showing three different boss characters attacking in a variety of biomes: one a cow/crab hybrid, one an elephant-like creature with a shell on its back, and on a wasp-like creation with crab claws.\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.webm?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.mp4?t=1789140388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/15439ac1fdec62e9c558930d66abd000.avif?t=1789140388\" alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;Features&amp;quot;\" width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>125+ evolution based abilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless possibilities and visual combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy-defining evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many viable survival strategies and playstyles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/2b990ccfd94bdf